logue: 103,0:01:37.89,0:01:38.44,Romaji-OP19_R,,0,0,0,fx,can!Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.44,0:01:38.68,Romaji-OP19_P,,0,0,0,fx,caDialogue: 0,0:01:41.80,0:01:44.80,Title,,0,0,250,,The Curly Hat Pirates ArriveDialogue: 0,0:01:44.87,0:01:50.20,Captions,,0,507,7,,1,000,000 BELLYDialogue: 0,0:01:54.86,0:01:59.83,Main,,0,0,0,,It must be the ancient version of the Elephant Fruit. You ate such a rare fruit!Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.28,0:02:03.28,Main,,0,0,0,,They've still got this many soldiers.Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.00,0:02:16.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You should've withdrawn while the dog was treating you nicely!Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.54,0:02:17.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Master!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:22.38,Main,,0,0,0,,We have just as many soldiers as some major countries!Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:26.99,Main,,0,0,0,,Bepo!Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.46,0:02:29.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You-gara guys are still under my care!Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:32.63,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't need to fight!Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.04,0:02:36.07,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not gonna work that way, Master!Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.64,0:02:40.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Although I became a pirate, this is still my home!Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.14,0:02:41.48,Main,,0,0,0,,To us...Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,It's our friend's home!Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:46.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't speak as if you're full-fledged.Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.72,0:02:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll destroy everything!Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:52.18,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll fight back!Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.18,0:03:21.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It's already morning!Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.14,0:03:28.12,Main,,0,0,0,,Haven't you given up yet, Jack?!Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.10,0:03:40.48,Main,,0,0,0,,We rotated our combatants by day and night...Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.48,0:03:45.58,Main,,0,0,0,,and continued fighting for two days, three days, four days, and so on.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.18,0:03:51.80,Main,,0,0,0,,But Jack's reinforcements kept coming from the sea and we could hardly fend them off.Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.24,0:03:55.74,Main,,0,0,0,,It was like fighting a wave of countless zombies!Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:04:00.76,Main,,0,0,0,,However we were steadily overwhelming the enemy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.08,0:04:07.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I can say there was only one that we couldn't bring down and that was...Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.82,0:04:08.99,Main,,0,0,0,,...Jack!Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.12,0:04:12.23,Main,,0,0,0,,He is, indeed, a monster!Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.57,0:04:15.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Hmmm.Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:19.96,Main,,0,0,0,,The guy who even this old man couldn't beat was Kaido's subordinate.Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:20.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.59,0:04:23.99,Main,,0,0,0,,But the enemy was having a hard time too.Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:29.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I think Jack got tired of the two rulers who he couldn't take downDialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:33.06,Main,,0,0,0,,so he finally brought out a weapon on the fifth day!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:36.02,Main,,0,0,0,,It was...Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.23,Main,,0,0,0,,...a poison-gas weapon.Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:45.60,Main,,0,0,0,,It all happened so quickly.Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.62,0:04:52.52,Main,,0,0,0,,The deadly gas was filling the whole country at the speed of a blast wave!Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:54.80,Main,,0,0,0,,How could anyone escape that?!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.98,0:05:03.90,Main,,0,0,0,,The gas filled up the whole city and half of the forest and totally paralyzed us.Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.90,0:05:09.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Except for the people who evacuated to the back of the fortress, nearly everyone was incapacitated.Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.24,0:05:12.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to remember...Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:14.45,Main,,0,0,0,,...what happened after that!Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:20.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Answer the question!Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.32,0:05:24.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's the warrior from the Land of Wano?Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.89,0:05:25.76,Main,,0,0,0,,He's not here!Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.28,0:05:36.35,Main,,0,0,0,,They kept asking questions they knew the answer to!Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.35,0:05:39.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Then they brutalized our soldiers and ruined our country!Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.56,0:05:47.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, they found Master Nekomamushi and the Guardians who were paralyzed by the gas...Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.26,0:05:51.30,Main,,0,0,0,,...and did the same to them.Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:54.40,Main,,0,0,0,,But when they saw they weren't getting anywhere...Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.55,0:05:59.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Our tough ones were crucified...Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.50,0:06:02.20,Main,,0,0,0,,...and tortured.Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Where's the warrior from the Land of Wano?!Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.70,0:06:06.97,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know!Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.97,0:06:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't hide anyone like that!Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:13.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Please stop...Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.55,0:06:19.76,Main,,0,0,0,,No one in this country knows anything about that!Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.76,0:06:23.63,Main,,0,0,0,,We're really dying for nothing! You have no mercy!Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.98,0:06:40.55,Main,,0,0,0,,I won't let this go even if I die, Jack!Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:44.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Until the day I curse you-gara to death with my cat-grudge!Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:54.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Those tragic events lasted one whole day... and on the sixth day...Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:07:00.10,Main,,0,0,0,,maybe because Jack was satisfied with the destruction or tired of hearing the same answer...Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.87,0:07:05.87,Main,,0,0,0,,he left a few dozen of his men behind and departed from the island.Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.87,0:07:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,That's too awful!Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:10.03,Main,,0,0,0,,There was no salvation.Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.03,0:07:13.32,Main,,0,0,0,,No, that actually saved us too.Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.32,0:07:15.06,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were up!Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.38,0:07:19.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I noticed that when I read Jack's obituary in the newspaper.Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:23.94,Captions,,230,0,220,,Jack dies!Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:23.94,Captions,,0,0,0,,The prominent member of the Beasts PiratesDialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:23.94,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Jack the Drought"Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.12,0:07:23.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, so this is Jack.Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:27.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The day you-gara people took down Doflamingo,Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.62,0:07:30.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Jack left this country.Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:35.66,Main,,0,0,0,,He left here to go save Doflamingo.Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess they had some sort of a deep connection.Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:44.41,Main,,0,0,0,,So the ones who drove that monster out of here were...Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.41,0:07:45.94,Main,,0,0,0,,...you-gara people.Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.44,0:07:50.45,Main,,0,0,0,,He fell asleep again!Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.78,0:07:53.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I see!Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.25,0:07:57.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Given all that, I'm even more grateful to you all and feel it was truly a miracle!Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:08:02.13,Main,,0,0,0,,We arrived here the very next day after Jack left!Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.54,0:08:07.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.89,0:08:09.26,Main,,0,0,0,,...Zou?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:17.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I warn you! I don't like the idea of landing here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:23.37,Main,,0,0,0,,You bastards!Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up and keep going!Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.63,0:08:27.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn! I'll get even with you buttholes!Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that...Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:47.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-kun!Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:49.98,Main,,0,0,0,,The gate is...Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.98,0:08:53.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like it was broken open with tremendous force.Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:55.36,Main,,0,0,0,,There was obviously an invasion!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.36,0:08:58.94,Main,,0,0,0,,A-An invasion?! Are they our enemies too?!Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.94,0:09:02.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook! Look after Nami-san here. I'll go check inside.Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.86,0:09:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,No problem.Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.42,0:09:07.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'll look after Onami too!Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.30,0:09:09.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Caesar! Let's go!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Why should I go along...Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.18,0:09:12.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up and get moving!Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:14.78,Main,,0,0,0,,See you later!Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:16.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't take too long!Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.30,Main,,0,0,0,,It looks abandoned.Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:22.37,Main,,0,0,0,,There's no guard or gatekeeper. What happened?Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Somebody, help!Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.27,0:09:26.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.90,0:09:30.65,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.20,0:09:33.32,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Was she the one who talked?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:34.92,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.78,0:09:39.86,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh, he definitely looks like a villain! That means she is a victim!Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:41.74,Main,,0,0,0,,This way!Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.64,0:09:46.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait, you little squirrel!Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:49.55,Main,,0,0,0,,We just wanna crucify you and ask some questions!Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:50.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you guys?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.80,0:09:52.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook! Can you handle them?!Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.04,0:09:53.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.54,0:10:06.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Go!Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:13.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Soul Parade!Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.86,0:10:18.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Ice Burn!Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.68,0:10:23.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes!Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.47,0:10:25.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Good job, Bonekichi!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:27.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.36,0:10:30.26,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,A talking skeleton and eel! I'm scared!Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.34,0:10:35.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! Hey, you! What's happening on this island?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.18,0:10:44.89,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:47.20,Main,,0,0,0,,It's filled with gas.Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.32,0:10:51.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Are those all animals on the ground?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.47,0:10:55.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Idiot! They're the Mink Tribe! Don't you know?!Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.80,0:11:03.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's go back to the forest for now! We'll be killed by the gas!Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.13,0:11:04.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you-gara people...Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:09.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Tsk! Seems like they're still alive.Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:13.24,Main,,0,0,0,,You're not their-gara's allies, are you?Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.66,0:11:17.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm Pedro! Will you help me?Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.96,0:11:19.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Please!Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:26.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Duke Inuarashi and Master Nekomamushi need to be treated as soon as possible!Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:30.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, they're going to die...Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:40.24,Main,,0,0,0,,The world is waiting for them.Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.78,0:11:44.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Those two men...Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.62,0:11:47.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We shall never ever...Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:52.06,Main,,0,0,0,,...let them die!Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:08.25,Captions,,0,0,170,,Zou, 10 days agoDialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:05.97,Main,,0,0,3,,Boy! I can't believe it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:08.77,Main,,0,0,3,,The whole country has been ravaged by the poison gas!Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.82,0:12:12.68,Main,,0,0,0,,I got the chills seeing its power!Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.04,0:12:16.41,Main,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:19.20,Main,,0,0,0,,The name of the gas is Koro!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:22.22,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a weapon of mass destruction that I invented!Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.22,0:12:23.78,Main,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.78,0:12:26.69,Main,,0,0,0,,I said that gas was made by me...Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.70,0:12:33.82,Main,,0,0,0,,What?! Why should I take the blame?!Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.24,0:12:36.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who used it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.75,0:12:38.50,Main,,0,0,0,,This guy is the worst!Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.50,0:12:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't made it, no one would've fallen victim to it!Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.33,0:12:44.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can neutralize it with your ability!Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.89,0:12:46.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Do it now!Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.40,0:12:50.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Then, make an antidote! It's not too late yet!Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.55,0:12:56.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Considering how much it cleared away, more than a day has passed already!Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:12:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Not again!Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.62,0:13:02.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't think the underdogs are always good!Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:09.43,Main,,0,0,0,,The Mink Tribe is known for disliking humans and their great fighting strength!Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.43,0:13:12.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Leave them alone for your own good!Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.05,0:13:15.32,Main,,0,0,0,,They'll bite us to death as soon as we save them!Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.76,0:13:18.11,Main,,0,0,0,,Bite us to death?Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.22,0:13:31.30,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm losing my power...Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:33.78,Main,,0,0,0,,It's salty! It's seawater!Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.26,0:13:36.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:50.91,Main,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you save me a little more gently?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.91,0:13:53.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining after I saved you!Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.66,0:13:58.72,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Nami-san's voice!Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.34,0:14:00.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen, Caesar!Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:05.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Get the poison gas you created out of the city before I come back!Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.60,0:14:07.27,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:10.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I'll crush your heart here in my fist and...Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.36,0:14:13.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Alright! You devil!Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji, leave him in my hands.Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:18.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks!Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:23.75,Main,,0,0,0,,There she is!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:24.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Brook!Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.90,0:14:26.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Keep stalling him like that!Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:27.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:30.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Diable! Mouton...Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.52,0:14:30.74,Note,,0,0,0,,Devil MuttonDialogue: 0,0:14:31.22,0:14:32.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Shot!Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:38.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheepshead-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:41.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys! Retreat!Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.44,0:14:43.48,Main,,0,0,0,,Sheepshead-sama has been taken down!Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.48,0:14:44.56,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.56,0:14:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,But we haven't found the samurai yet!Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:49.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Although we cornered them this far, he didn't show himself!Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.59,0:14:52.15,Main,,0,0,0,,The samurai's not here! Tell him so!Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.15,0:14:53.18,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.78,0:14:57.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Do it! Neutralize the gas!Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:15:02.15,Main,,0,0,0,,How annoying. All right. I'll do it! Are you happy now?!Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:05.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Koro-neutralizing gas!Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.70,0:15:08.79,Main,,0,0,0,,This is so against my will!Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.72,0:15:12.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Roko!Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.08,0:15:50.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's good!Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Guys!Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:55.23,Main,,0,0,0,,Get over here now!Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.22,0:15:59.45,Main,,0,0,0,,That's Chopperemon! From the forest down below!Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.45,0:16:01.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go now! There's no time to lose!Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:07.62,Main,,0,0,0,,Th-This is awful!Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Were they all killed by Caesar's weapon?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:16.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Most of the people have been wiped out.Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:18.99,Main,,0,0,0,,It must've been done by those fools from earlier.Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.99,0:16:21.44,Main,,0,0,0,,You mean those people who just attacked us?Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.24,0:16:25.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Seems like Caesar neutralized the gas successfully...Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.38,0:16:28.20,Main,,0,0,0,,But they've done so much damage.Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:32.67,Main,,0,0,0,,So there is a chance that a lot of them are still hiding somewhere on the island.Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.67,0:16:37.88,Main,,0,0,0,,According to the gas idiot, the Mink Tribe is a savage race.Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:43.70,Main,,0,0,0,,We might end up regretting that we saved them but...Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.10,0:16:46.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you-teia guys Jack's allies too?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.20,0:16:50.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san!Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:52.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait! It's okay!Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.36,0:16:54.78,Main,,0,0,0,,She's weakened by the poison!Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.50,0:17:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! She has an explosive!Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.62,0:17:08.32,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.46,0:17:16.56,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you-teia people! Never!Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:21.68,Main,,0,0,0,,What did we do to you?! What do you gain from killing us?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.69,0:17:24.62,Main,,0,0,0,,The person you-teia are looking for isn't here!Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.06,0:17:28.56,Main,,0,0,0,,This country has a millennium-long history!Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:31.78,Main,,0,0,0,,How much do you have to destroy to get your fill?!Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.95,0:17:50.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Wanda-san!Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.35,0:17:53.14,Main,,0,0,0,,Those-teia people saved me!Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:54.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Tristan!Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:57.82,Main,,0,0,0,,All of Jack's subordinates have just left the island!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:17:59.74,Main,,0,0,0,,What? Left?Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:01.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Did they-teia?Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:05.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro!Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Wanda...Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:09.56,Main,,0,0,0,,They-gara have nothing to do with Jack.Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.56,0:18:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,The poison gas has just cleared away from the city...Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.90,0:18:20.04,Main,,0,0,0,,...because of their-gara magic.Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.04,0:18:23.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, the gas is gone.Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.48,0:18:24.90,Main,,0,0,0,,You-teia people...Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.16,0:18:27.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Who are you?Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.65,0:18:29.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?!Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:30.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:34.19,Main,,0,0,0,,More than a day has passed since the gas was released!Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:36.90,Main,,0,0,0,,To counteract this gas, we have to give the poisoned onesDialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:39.83,Main,,0,0,0,,the antidote within 48 hours or it'll be too late for them!Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.83,0:18:40.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What's that?Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.90,0:18:41.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.75,0:18:45.86,Main,,0,0,0,,To save everybody in the country, we can't even waste a second!Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.86,0:18:49.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is there a hospital?! I need more instruments and medicine!Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:51.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Bring everybody who can help here!Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:54.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor! Do as I say!Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:59.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you going to... save us?Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.24,0:19:05.26,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought we were going to die... All of us!Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.26,0:19:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,We won't give up on anybody!Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.85,0:19:39.28,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll play some soothing music.Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:47.91,Main,,0,0,0,,You didn't even know who we were!Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.05,0:19:51.85,Main,,0,0,0,,But you saved us without giving up.Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.51,0:19:57.09,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll never forget what you did for us!Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.53,0:19:59.96,Main,,0,0,0,,We'll pay our debt to you someday!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.96,0:20:02.29,Main,,0,0,0,,No, no! You don't have to do that!Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.41,0:20:09.95,Main,,0,0,0,,You guys did such a nice thing! I'm so proud of you!Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.49,0:20:13.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it was that serious...Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.12,0:20:16.49,Main,,0,0,0,,Now I understand why we were so welcomed.Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:22.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, that Jack guy makes me mad!Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.43,0:20:26.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll kick his butt as well as Kaido's someday!Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.67,0:20:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,But he said there was an obituary...Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:35.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, it's hard to believe if you had seen him with your own eyes.Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.85,0:20:38.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Guys, will you stay here and talk?Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:42.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna go somewhere, Chopper?Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.24,0:20:48.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It's night now so I'll go examine Nekomamushi, the King of the Night, and the Guardians of the Whale Forest!Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.19,0:20:50.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll take you there with my Warney.Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.83,0:20:55.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, Wanda, isn't it time for you to sleep too?Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.01,0:20:58.37,Main,,0,0,0,,I work as a Kingsbird.Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:20:59.89,Main,,0,0,0,,A Kingsbird?Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.89,0:21:03.93,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes - an aide to the kings and the only office that isDialogue: 0,0:21:03.93,0:21:07.85,Main,,0,0,0,,allowed to go back and forth between them regardless of whether it's day or night.Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.03,0:21:10.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's an important job!Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.81,0:21:14.82,Main,,0,0,0,,I have to tell him that Duke Inuarashi is okay.Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:17.44,Main,,0,0,0,,He'd probably say it's unnecessary.Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:20.59,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll come with you! I wanna see Nekomamushi!Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.79,0:21:26.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Master Nekomamushi! I like him so much! I'll come with you!Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.89,0:21:35.07,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a full moon tonight but I'm glad that it's covered by the clouds.Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.97,0:21:37.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Be careful!Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:37.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.55,0:21:40.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Carrot, for giving us a ride.Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.95,0:21:43.11,Main,,0,0,0,,That's okay. I'm a Kingsbird too.Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.21,0:21:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Wanda, so far in your story...Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.37,0:21:54.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, both Twirly Eyebrows and Gassy hadn't left yet.Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.19,0:21:57.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you what happened to them.Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.61,0:22:08.77,Main,,0,0,0,,The thing is we didn't tell that many people in this country about this.Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:14.18,Main,,0,0,0,,We didn't want to make the people who had their country ruined worry more.Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.93,0:22:23.99,Main,,0,0,0,,This was a big event that happened secretly just two days ago.Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.59,0:22:26.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Please be prepared for what you're going to hear.Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.75,0:22:30.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji-san might not...Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.59,0:22:33.70,Main,,0,0,0,,...come back to us.Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.70,0:22:34.90,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.90,0:22:36.02,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa.Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.02,0:22:37.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Why, Brook?!Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.45,0:22:40.84,Main,,0,0,0,,It says "I'll be back" in his note!Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.84,0:22:43.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I told you it's actually more complicated!Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.75,0:22:47.17,Main,,0,0,0,,He will be back! I believe in Sanji!Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.27,0:22:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, please relax, Luffy-san.Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.50,0:22:54.87,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you what happened from the beginning.Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.87,0:22:55.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.07,0:22:59.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This island of Zou that we're on is the Phantom Island.Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.25,0:23:05.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Because the island itself is a living thing, you can't get here even with a Log PoseDialogue: 0,0:23:05.83,0:23:08.53,Main,,0,0,0,,or find it in a normal way. But...Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:13.10,Main,,0,0,0,,We made a blunder and had a blind spot.Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.49,0:23:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,First, at that time...Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.29,0:23:19.97,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You go ahead and sail for Zou!Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.67,0:23:27.15,Main,,0,0,0,,We allowed the enemy ship that we'd shaken off to know our destination.Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.72,0:23:32.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Second, someone from the Phantom Island was on their ship.Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.25,0:23:38.51,Main,,0,0,0,,So the ones who showed up in front of us two days ago were...Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.03,0:23:41.43,Main,,0,0,0,,...Emperor Big Mom's pirate group!Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.87,0:23:46.64,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.13,0:23:48.55,Main,,0,0,0,,We arrived.Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.13,0:23:53.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no problem. Count on us, Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.31,0:23:55.61,Main,,0,0,0,,The two of us can finish this.Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.77,0:23:59.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Zou is where I came from! Grr!Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.98,0:24:03.00,OP11 Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing: Galaxy 9000  Timing: Datenshi, Sewil  QC: Mr Luffy, Galaxy 9000  Soundtracking: Halee  TC/Infoboxes: Datenshi  Translation: Yibis